    <item>
      <title>abcdefghijklmnopqrst in a title breaks at twelve</title>
      <link>http://mathnews.uwaterloo.ca/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 30 Nov -0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[mathNEWS]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">http://mathnews.uwaterloo.ca/</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded>
<![CDATA[<h1>abcdefghijkl in a heading is exactly the heading threshold</h1>

<h2>abcdefghijklm in a heading is one over</h2>

<h3>abcdefghijklmnopqrst in a heading breaks early</h3>

<h6>abcdefghijklmnopqrst breaks in an h6 too</h6>

<h2>a heading with <em>abcdefghijklmnopqrst</em> nested inside a tag</h2>

<h2><em>abcdefg</em>abcdefgh is fifteen across an em tag, which is over twelve</h2>

<h2>a heading holding <a href="https://example.org/x">abcdefghijklmnopqrst</a> as link text</h2>

[caption]abcdefghijklmnopqrst in a caption breaks at twelve too[/caption]

abcdefghijklmnopqrst is only twenty, so the same word is left alone in body text

<h2>abcdefghijkl. in a heading is thirteen only because of its period</h2>]]>
